  "declared_proposition": "Partition the even targets into finite blocks A_k. If G_N=M_N+E_N with integer G_N>=0 and M_N>0, then on every block # {N in A_k:G_N=0} <= B_k, where B_k=sum_{A_k}(E_N^-/M_N)^2. Therefore the shellwise condition B_k<1 for every k, together with a finite initial check, excludes all Goldbach exceptions. A single unit spike in each growing block has mean budget tending to zero while preserving one exception, so vanishing average error is insufficient.",
